{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "locale": "zh-CN",
  "scenario_id": "1_4_002_06_b",
  "source_raw_hash": "sha256:4f99fb026db7f8802139c8d2d17afb4d87a85eed9d24e47aa814601466bfe43e",
  "entries": {
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_06:1_4_002_06_b:cmd-000040:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:3ef4a259e6cd0e6cc7db4da20fb942f836678aa2554ddfe45be53b0f0fd6acb7",
      "text": "锐心你太谦虚啦——。\n真是的，这样一点挑战的意义都没有嘛！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_06:1_4_002_06_b:cmd-000055:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:cdf8465e51cea2469e0179c593944ca4969cd07d39756f18e0a6e6600680c647",
      "text": "我们明明是同一家事务所的伙伴兼对手吧。\n别在乎那些细节，尽管放马过来吧！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_06:1_4_002_06_b:cmd-000061:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:afa5b23d627307237cb879d5b0fde0c8647ebf1cb26d7ba9fee4949e1e940f06",
      "text": "而且，大家是比我们\n年长的高中生前辈呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_06:1_4_002_06_b:cmd-000070:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:093310d494b4f5b91c2885d700871ad3a27d8a3285c57402d175e06cbd24eb24",
      "text": "前辈啊～。\n315 Production里，有各种各样的前辈呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_06:1_4_002_06_b:cmd-000113:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:6bfa2f9d65e7d3f1e32bcf3c5f20633554252f4f25be9cb841d59c6c6f17509a",
      "text": "类老师是英语超——厉害的前辈吧。\n翼君和圭君，是软绵绵的前辈！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_06:1_4_002_06_b:cmd-000142:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:2717e304f2733469d3694a81c33adcd465dbb975385da0a4fbdaa44b5b3d7626",
      "text": "诚司先生和道流先生是肌肉猛男前辈……\n啊！次郎老师是邋里邋遢的前……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_06:1_4_002_06_b:cmd-000146:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:a24d7657e4f5a9c3b13cfdf9684e42082059701b84d0d1fd25aae3f2dd3aeb6e",
      "text": "花、花音君！\n呃，确实有很多前辈在呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_06:1_4_002_06_b:cmd-000155:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:edf948eb2ed4453e1e3fe5ae2e97b2db64ca9bf3163d097ab2305d14f4edf71e",
      "text": "嗯！大家都既温柔又有趣，花音最喜欢了！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_06:1_4_002_06_b:cmd-000163:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:4a7e12b3f00ee3be13de007ebde135795268595ab7f5e6d0c90cdc8225a637ed",
      "text": "呐呐，秀你们上的高中，\n是个什么样的地方啊？告诉我嘛！",
      "status": "draft"
    }
  }
}
